/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:320:   attachment; a reattachment composes a fresh dial with a fresh\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:335:    (throw (ex-info \"invalid DaoStream ws dial composition\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:348:(defn dial-attach!\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:350:   descriptor) through the dialed channel: the ws attach runs first,\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:355:   outcome. One dial value carries one active attachment: a dial that\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:356:   has already attached rejects a further dial-attach! -- its ring\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:359:   a composition error; a reattachment composes a fresh dial with a\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:360:   fresh cursor, as `dial` documents. Returns the remote attach!\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:362:  [dial descriptor]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:363:  (let [{:keys [attach! traffic cursor ring channel policy]} @dial]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:366:               \"this dial already attached its one active attachment\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:368:                :reattachment \"compose a fresh dial with a fresh cursor\"})))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:387:(defn dial-step!\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:388:  \"Drive the dialing composition one tick, at the composition's\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:394:  [dial]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:395:  (let [{:keys [ring table channel mirror-cursor]} @dial]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:405:  \"The dialed channel as data: {:attachment id :handle h :project p} --\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:407:   the attachment's projection. Nil before the first dial-attach!. A\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:410:  [dial]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws_project.cljc:411:  @(:channel @dial))\nsrc/cljc/datomworld/demo/earth_moon_scene.cljc:88:   up the +Y axis. UVs map radial position to v (0 at inner edge, 1 at outer)\nsrc/cljc/dao/j